 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My knees hurt. Both of them."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me when you first noticed your knee pain, whether it came on suddenly or gradually, what seemed to set it off if anything, and whether you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's been years, but much worse lately."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How bad is the knee pain for you these days?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It's bad enough that it's affecting my daily activities."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Could you tell me what medicines you take regularly or have taken recently, including any new or changed ones and the dose if you know it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I used to walk a lot, years back. My knees weren't like this then."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any long-term health problems?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, I haven't had anything else going on."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Along with the knee pain, have you noticed anything else going on in your body?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, nothing else I've noticed."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Which of these best describes any medicines you take regularly or have taken recently?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Anti-inflammatory medicines, for the knees."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do any everyday activities seem to make your knee pain better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Can't say I've noticed anything making it worse."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What worries you most about your knee pain when you think about it?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Can anything else be done, like surgery?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How would you describe the feeling in your knee when it bothers you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Just pain, really."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much does your knee pain bother you these days — not much, a little, or a lot, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "A lot. It's been getting worse."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How are things like your daily activities, sleep, appetite, or getting around these days with your knee pain?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I used to walk a lot years ago, remember."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
